game, trivialize any narrative short of fighting all the Yozi at once and are generally grotesquely over-powered.<br /> <br /> I have one word for anyone who thinks SMA are worse: Zeal.<br /> <br /> If you're playing an E6+ game then expect to hotfix and houserule.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> My favourite 2E game gave SMA to five Dragon-Blooded after they got hit with (pre-Errata) Pattern Spider Touch to make them the behemoth-blooded children of the actual Elemental Dragons on top of being Breeding 6 Dragon-Blooded. Good times.<br /> <br /> Generally speaking SMA is on a par with Solar Charms of equivalent Essence. DBs have smaller mote pools so it's not an immediate bump, but it's about equal to making them Akuma.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Ah, i remember reading that the sidereal martial arts where an example of why writing rules without knowing the core ones is a bad idea.<br /> But yeah, it's obviously a shaping attack. common sense<br /> <br /> <br /> When i mentioned Essence 6+ solar charms i was referring to the fixed ones from errata. Not zeal!! which is the platonic ideal of the word broken","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1492-mark","name":"mark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1492_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1379"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-22T15:48:40-08:00","id":1369680,"title":"","content":"Zeal only exists in original DotFA books, doesn't it? The official pdf of DotFA's two softcovers presumably doesn't include it, since it already has all of the errata and rules rewriting applied.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://