"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-22T21:46:44-08:00","id":1369748,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/1369532-how-broken-are-sidereal-martial-arts-in-second-edition?p=1369730#post1369730\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Baahhh I bought fucking Lords of Creation twice to try and see the pre-errata version of the Charms!</div> </div> </div> </div>So I take it that means that Zeal is indeed not in the official pdf...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-22T22:29:13-08:00","id":1369763,"title":"","content":"All I want to know is when the hell we're going to see the Sidereals book. Is it closer to 2 years or 4?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12167-broken-masque","name":"Broken Masque","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"41"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-22T23:51:27-08:00","id":1369778,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Broken Masque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/1369532-how-broken-are-sidereal-martial-arts-in-second-edition?p=1369763#post1369763\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">All I want to know is when the hell we're going to see the Sidereals book. Is it closer to 2 years or 4?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I am in no way official or have any insider knowledge. But what the Devs have said in the past suggests that the currently planned order of books covering Exalts is Lunars (the manuscript for which is already finished, has gone through a Kickstarter, and is in its close-to-final stages of production), then Exigents (the manuscript for which is still being written, but might have a Kickstarter some time in the upcoming year), and then Sidereals. The Sidereals' counterparts/rivals, the Getiminians, would ideally be coming out in the same year, though as a &quot;secondary&quot; Exalt type, their book is likely to be smaller. <br /> <br /> So, assuming the current production rate keeps up, you <i>might</i> see a Kickstarter, including a mostly-finalized manuscript, for Sidereals as early as sometime next year, but I wouldn't expect a finished book until two years from now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-23T11:37:26-08:00","id":1369883,"title":"","content":"I've waited this long, so I can wait a few more years.<br /> <br /> <br /> And as for broken SMA styles in 2e, yeah for the most part they are. Though I've been away for a while so I don't know what the current state of them is since I haven't seen the latest errata (if any).<br /> <br /> I did try to fix the mess that was Obsidian Shards of Infinity once, since the themeatics of using mirrors and reflections as tools for combat is a neat one, as well as the metaphysical concept of Reflection. I can't remember what I did to change it aside from largely just taking the charms and toning them down to what I felt were reasonable levels, for example the Charm that let you make copies of yourself didn't made 'perfect' copies anymore, and instead they used the character's mote pool (though any discounts from sutras and such did apply) and died instantly if they took a single point of damage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12167-broken-masque","name":"Broken Masque","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"41"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-23T17:32:16-08:00","id":1369934,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Broken Masque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/1369532-how-broken-are-sidereal-martial-arts-in-second-edition?p=1369763#post1369763\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">All I want to know is when the hell we're going to see the Sidereals book. Is it closer to 2 years or 4?</div> </div> </div> </div>If I heard right, you will get complete 3rd Ed rules for basic Sidereals in Exalted: Essence.<br /> <br /> It won't be a dedicated splat book, but should allow basic Sidreal characters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}